OL,3,GNEWSAPE teacher banned after changing
OL,4,Apupils' coursework
OL,5,
OL,6,FA PE teacher who changed students'
OL,7,Fcoursework has been banned from the
OL,8,Fprofession.
OL,10,FThomas Barge was the head of the PE
OL,11,Fdepartment at Ark Charter Academy in
OL,12,FPortsmouth from April 2022.
OL,14,FIn May 2023, three of Barge's
OL,15,Fcolleagues raised concerns about exam
OL,16,Fmalpractice in the department to the
OL,17,Fschool's head of centre and an
OL,18,Finvestigation was launched.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
