OL,3,GNEWSAPE teacher banned after changing
OL,4,Apupils' coursework
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarge admitted in written
OL,7,Frepresentations to a Teaching
OL,8,FRegulation Agency (TRA) hearing that he
OL,9,Fused pupils' coursework to improve or
OL,10,Fcomplete other pupils' work, as well as
OL,11,Fedited work to meet grading criteria.
